---
import Layout from '../../components/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact Us"
  description="Contact AffiliateBharat — corrections, deal tips or partnerships at hello@affiliatebharat.com."
  lang="en"
  canonicalPath="/en/contact/"
>
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/en/' }, { label: 'Contact' }]} />
  <article class="page">
    <h1>Contact Us</h1>
    <p class="lede">Questions, corrections or deal tips — write in, you'll get a reply.</p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      For everything:
      <a href="mailto:hello@affiliatebharat.com">hello@affiliatebharat.com</a>
    </p>

    <h2>What's useful to send</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Corrections:</strong> spotted a wrong price or outdated info in an article? Send it with a screenshot — we verify and update.</li>
      <li><strong>Deal tips:</strong> found a genuine offer we haven't covered? Send the link and we'll check it out.</li>
      <li><strong>Topic requests:</strong> tell us which product or comparison you'd like a guide on.</li>
      <li><strong>Partnerships:</strong> brand or agency queries go to the same email — but note that paid placements never affect our rankings.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Response time</h2>
    <p>
      We're a small team — most emails get a reply within 2–3 days.
      For urgent corrections, put "Correction" in the subject line and it gets priority.
    </p>

    <h2>Social media</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@fkdigitalmedia" rel="noopener">YouTube — @fkdigitalmedia</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/rtibyfiroz" rel="noopener">Instagram — @rtibyfiroz</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/fkdigitalmedia" rel="noopener">GitHub — fkdigitalmedia</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Please don't send</h2>
    <p>
      Spam, bulk promotional emails and "guest post for backlink" proposals don't get replies.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page { max-width: 760px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 2.6rem); margin: 0 0 0.8rem; }
  .lede { font-size: 1.12rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .page h2 { margin: 2.2rem 0 0.8rem; font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .page p, .page li { font-size: 1.02rem; }
  .page ul { padding-left: 1.4rem; }
  .page li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
</style>
